        "ggPYB-oHzpS_text": "<p>Free Global Shipping Above $50</p>",
        "ggatvf3OoBt_text": "<p>1 Year Warranty</p>",
        "gg9Y6HH0j02_text": "<p>Secure online payment</p>",
        "ggExFQ0IQBu_text": "<p>30 Days Return</p>",
        "ggkCsU8innO_text": "<p>Secure Checkout With:</p>",
        "ggEks8-3r3j_childItem_0": "<p>Product Details</p>",
        "ggEks8-3r3j_childItem_1": "<p>Return and Refund Policy</p>",
        "ggzPwj8Kr63_text": "<p>NOVALIGHT™ Regenmask 2.0 is an advanced LED therapy mask engineered for targeted skincare support with professional-level settings. It features seven different wavelengths, including red, blue, green, yellow, purple, cyan, and white light. Each light serves a specific function—from soothing inflammation to addressing discoloration and supporting overall skin clarity.</p>",
        "ggEb3w8J-nI_text": "<p>Please note the change in our refund policy regarding skin care products. For hygiene reasons, all products intended for skin care are neither refundable nor exchangeable, as specified in our general terms and conditions of sale.</p>"
